{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10009","headline":"郡中客舍 · 黄麟","name":"郡中客舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虫响乱啾啾，更人正数筹。\n魂归洞庭夜，霜卧洛阳秋。\n微月有时隐，长河到晓流。\n起来还嘱雁，乡信在吴洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄麟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}